So today I was doing pretty well with a Neu Hum Val, and made it to DL
21. As I'm walking around a blast of disintegration hits me! Then
another hit! Luckily Sokoban had yielded an Amulet of Reflection. There
aren't many enemies who would still be zapping after they had the beam
reflected back at them.  I got up close and personal and dispatched the
dragon, but consumed all of my extra healing potions in the process.
And yes! it left a corpse. I was eager to get that precious
disintegration resistance intrinsic so I began eating immediately. I
was constantly disturbed by various enemies shooting at me, and barely
paying attention I kept cutting them down, without paying much
attention to my HP.

Then bam... I'm fighting an Olog-Hai. And it's a CLOSE match. It had 30
hp left and I had about 40. I zapped a wand of fire at it, bringing it
to 6 hp and myself to 20 hp. For some reason (well, I foolishly wanted
to save a wand charge I guess) decided to melee that last hit. Note: I
had a stethoscope for anyone who was wondering if I was just guessing
about its HP.

I hit. It didn't die. DYWYPI?

Anyway, that's the retarded death part. I stared at the screen for a
minute, then proceeded to beat my own head for a few seconds.
Arrrrghhhh...

But it made me think, wouldn't it be nice if your god would fully heal
